title: Proposition 21
---
order: 21
---
short_label: VI.21
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Figures which are similar to the same rectilinear figure are also similar to one another.
----
proof:

Let each of the rectilinear figures *A* and *B* be similar to *C.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="450" height="250" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="VI.21 diagram" src="propVI21.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
        background: "35,19,100",
        title: "VI.21",
        elements: [
            "A1;point;free;30,40;0",
            "A2;point;free;70,210;0",
            "A3;point;free;170,210;0",
            "A4;point;free;155,100;0",
            "A;polygon;quadrilateral;A1,A2,A3,A4;black;0;black;random",
            "B2;point;free;240,210;0",
            "B3;point;free;310,210;0",
            "B1;point;similar;B2,B3,A2,A3,A1;0",
            "B4;point;similar;B2,B3,A2,A3,A4;0",
            "B;polygon;quadrilateral;B1,B2,B3,B4;black;0;black;random",
            "C2;point;free;350,210;0",
            "C3;point;free;400,210;0",
            "C1;point;similar;C2,C3,A2,A3,A1;0",
            "C4;point;similar;C2,C3,A2,A3,A4;0",
            "C;polygon;quadrilateral;C1,C2,C3,C4;black;0;black;random"
        ],
    });
</script>
</figure>

I say that *A* is also similar to *B.*

Since *A* is similar to *C,* it is equiangular with it and has the sides about the equal angles proportional. [!just VI.Def.1]

Again, since *B* is similar to *C,* it is equiangular with it and has the sides about the equal angles proportional.

Therefore each of the figures *A* and *B* is equiangular with *C* and with *C* has the sides about the equal angles proportional, therefore *A* is similar to *B.* [!just V.11]

Therefore, *figures which are similar to the same rectilinear figure are also similar to one another.*

<div class="qed">Q.E.D.</div>
<br clear="all">
----
guide: This proposition is used in the proofs of propositions @VI.24, @VI.28, and @VI.29.  It also would have been useful in the proof of @VI.8.
